# Git commits

When creating commits in this repository:

- **Never** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any Cursor co-author line to commit messages.
- Use plain HEREDOC messages only; do not append co-author trailers.
- Run `scripts/install-git-hooks.sh` once per clone so `.githooks/commit-msg` strips accidental trailers.
